    {
      "id": "u_9e0903bd2cce50ae56e67e72_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This tutorial showcases a basic integration with Google Forms, where we are able to download the responses of a form using the “Link to Sheets\" functionality.",
      "sourceHash": "9e0903bd2cce50ae56e67e72441d55e08a59c2f7da6296e8f74dd108142b04e9",
      "context": "Downloading responses from Google Forms",
      "contextHash": "85a7a592fb05a4e79ab4abaf0ec8f2b37f1d7c1cad2f6cbeb33c875f2f015075",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_36c75e83935d642ec5ac7e75_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Note that the link will be publicly accessible to everyone (however the link is in a hard-to-guess format such as __TRILIUM_PH_0__). Make sure you are not accidentally publishing sensitive information.",
      "sourceHash": "36c75e83935d642ec5ac7e75997151bf1b28e9fcef44c51cf07145c11819a5ed",
      "context": "Downloading responses from Google Forms",
      "contextHash": "85a7a592fb05a4e79ab4abaf0ec8f2b37f1d7c1cad2f6cbeb33c875f2f015075",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
